  /// compliance. To include all frames from your input in this output, keep
  /// the default setting, Allow any duration. The number of frames that
  /// MediaConvert excludes when you set this to Drop frames for compliance
  /// depends on the output frame rate and duration.
  pub duration_mode: MxfXavcDurationMode? = None
  /// Specify a value for this setting only for outputs that you set up with
